# EXPONENTIAL field-chain typing in RETURN position, a REGRESSION after 2026-09-12.
#
# The identical chain written as `_ = a.b.b...` is flat (0.03s); as `return a.b.b...` it is
# exponential: ~3.9s at 28 links on the current product, 0.03s on the Sep-12 product. The
# position is the whole difference, so a return-specific path re-walks the chain.
#
# This is the shape that HANGS the internal-suite differential gate: its corpus carries
# chain.elisa with ~270 links (field_chain_exponential_corpus.elisa here), which never finishes.
# stage0 rejects that input in under a second.
#
# Ruled out by measurement, not by reading: the parser (-emit ast/fmt/tokens are flat at any
# depth), the `::` path checker (a `a::b::b...` chain of the same depth is flat),
# check_type_path_separator, and d65b92dc's three-pass struct_field_row_for_type (restoring the
# old single-scan lookups left the curve unchanged).
def f(a: i64) -> i64:
    return a.b.b.b.b.b.b.b.b.b.b.b.b.b.b.b.b.b.b.b.b.b.b.b.b.b.b.b.b
